      "description": "Contenedor blanco con título y filas nombre / monto.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h3 class=\"ds-panel__titulo\">Obligatorios</h3><ul><li><span>Alquiler</span><b><small>$</small>350.000</b></li><li><span>Servicios</span><b><small>$</small>48.200</b></li></ul></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{padding:20px 22px;border-radius:18px;background:var(--superficie,#fff);border:1px solid var(--linea,#d6ddd7);color:var(--tinta,#16211c);font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-panel__titulo{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:700}.ds-panel ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.ds-panel li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linea-suave,#e6ebe6)}.ds-panel li:last-child{border-bottom:0}.ds-panel li span{flex:1}.ds-panel b{font:500 1.25rem \"Barlow Condensed\",\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-panel small{font-size:0.62em;opacity:0.7;margin-right:0.18em}"
